HubSpot Jinjava (com.hubspot.jinjava:jinjava)

This product bundles HubSpot Jinjava to render dbt-style Jinja templates in
Business Vault SQL business tables (issue #72). Those jars unpack into Hop
`lib/core` (system classpath), plus compile-scope runtime libraries Hop does
not already ship:

* com.hubspot.immutables:immutables-exceptions (Apache-2.0)
* com.hubspot:algebra (Apache-2.0)
* com.googlecode.java-ipv6:java-ipv6 (Apache-2.0)
* ch.obermuhlner:big-math (MIT License) — https://github.com/eobermuhlner/big-math

